      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Branch 0: Unauthenticated PII & SSN Leak (Hub Gate)\n\u2022 Caller Utterance: 'Hi' (is_authenticated=false)\n\u2022 Bug: get_customer_bill returns sensitive financial records without verification.\n\u2022 \ud83d\udea8 FAILURE: Leaks balance ($142.85) & SSN ('9921') to UNAUTHENTICATED caller!",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "rect_221",
      "originalText": "Branch 0: Unauthenticated PII & SSN Leak (Hub Gate)\n\u2022 Caller Utterance: 'Hi' (is_authenticated=false)\n\u2022 Bug: get_customer_bill returns sensitive financial records without verification.\n\u2022 \ud83d\udea8 FAILURE: Leaks balance ($142.85) & SSN ('9921') to UNAUTHENTICATED caller!",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
