      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Branch 1: 35-Second Cascading Gateway Timeout (Billing)\n\u2022 Caller Utterance: 'I want to know my bill' (Simulated latency: 35s)\n\u2022 Bug: No client timeout budget; backend hangs indefinitely.\n\u2022 \ud83d\udea8 FAILURE: Exceeds Harpoon 30s platform limit; crashes call with dead air!",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "rect_237",
      "originalText": "Branch 1: 35-Second Cascading Gateway Timeout (Billing)\n\u2022 Caller Utterance: 'I want to know my bill' (Simulated latency: 35s)\n\u2022 Bug: No client timeout budget; backend hangs indefinitely.\n\u2022 \ud83d\udea8 FAILURE: Exceeds Harpoon 30s platform limit; crashes call with dead air!",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
