      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "WAF: Reliability & Performance Optimization (Client SLA Budgets)\n\u2022 Interceptor: Clean Tool Facade DTO with bounded timeout wrapper.\n\u2022 SLA Architecture: Client timeout (5s) < Backend gateway (10s) < Harpoon limit (30s).\n\u2022 Graceful Degradation: Converts network timeout into self-service recovery route.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "rect_241",
      "originalText": "WAF: Reliability & Performance Optimization (Client SLA Budgets)\n\u2022 Interceptor: Clean Tool Facade DTO with bounded timeout wrapper.\n\u2022 SLA Architecture: Client timeout (5s) < Backend gateway (10s) < Harpoon limit (30s).\n\u2022 Graceful Degradation: Converts network timeout into self-service recovery route.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
