      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Remediation: Bounded 5s SLA & Ticket Fallback\n\u2022 Tool enforces 5.0s SLA timeout; intercepts slow billing ledger.\n\u2022 \u2705 Returns error_code='BILLING_GATEWAY_TIMEOUT' (timeout_seconds=5).\n\u2022 Agent Action: Apologizes and creates ticket via submit_support_ticket.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "rect_245",
      "originalText": "Remediation: Bounded 5s SLA & Ticket Fallback\n\u2022 Tool enforces 5.0s SLA timeout; intercepts slow billing ledger.\n\u2022 \u2705 Returns error_code='BILLING_GATEWAY_TIMEOUT' (timeout_seconds=5).\n\u2022 Agent Action: Apologizes and creates ticket via submit_support_ticket.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
