      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Branch 2: 503 Infinite Retry Loop (Connectivity Telemetry)\n\u2022 Caller Utterance: 'My internet is not working' (Backend returns 503)\n\u2022 Bug: Monolithic prompt commands 'keep retrying at least 5 times in a loop'.\n\u2022 \ud83d\udea8 FAILURE: Tool returns retry_allowed=True indefinitely; infinite IAL loop!",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "rect_253",
      "originalText": "Branch 2: 503 Infinite Retry Loop (Connectivity Telemetry)\n\u2022 Caller Utterance: 'My internet is not working' (Backend returns 503)\n\u2022 Bug: Monolithic prompt commands 'keep retrying at least 5 times in a loop'.\n\u2022 \ud83d\udea8 FAILURE: Tool returns retry_allowed=True indefinitely; infinite IAL loop!",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
