      "text": "Remediation: Stateful 1-Retry Circuit Breaker\n\u2022 On attempt 2, tool trips circuit breaker (retry_allowed=False).\n\u2022 \u2705 Returns error_code='503_CIRCUIT_BREAKER_OPEN'.\n\u2022 Agent Action: Stops retries, guides modem power reboot, logs ticket.",
