      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "WAF: Security, Privacy & Operational Excellence (Clean Data Facades)\n\u2022 Principle: Never pass raw backend database objects or ORM models to LLM context.\n\u2022 Interceptor: Clean Data Facade DTO + after_tool_callback scrub layer.\n\u2022 Sanitizer: Strips internal_api_token, db_host, and private phones defense-in-depth.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "rect_273",
      "originalText": "WAF: Security, Privacy & Operational Excellence (Clean Data Facades)\n\u2022 Principle: Never pass raw backend database objects or ORM models to LLM context.\n\u2022 Interceptor: Clean Data Facade DTO + after_tool_callback scrub layer.\n\u2022 Sanitizer: Strips internal_api_token, db_host, and private phones defense-in-depth.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
