      "text": "Remediation: Clean Data Facade DTO & Scrubbing\n\u2022 find_nearest_store projects ONLY public store_name, address, hours.\n\u2022 \u2705 Defense-in-depth: after_tool_callback purges internal keys.\n\u2022 Agent Action: Safely reads verified public store location to caller.",
