      "versionNonce": 584,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "WAF: Security & Privacy (Zero-Trust Tool Data Sanitization)\n\u2022 Principle: Treat all external data payloads as completely untrusted input.\n\u2022 Interceptor: Tool-level regex scrubber + after_tool_callback injection filter.\n\u2022 Data Envelope: Tags data_trust_level='UNTRUSTED_EXTERNAL_DATA'.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "rect_289",
      "originalText": "WAF: Security & Privacy (Zero-Trust Tool Data Sanitization)\n\u2022 Principle: Treat all external data payloads as completely untrusted input.\n\u2022 Interceptor: Tool-level regex scrubber + after_tool_callback injection filter.\n\u2022 Data Envelope: Tags data_trust_level='UNTRUSTED_EXTERNAL_DATA'.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
