      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Branch 5: Ungrounded Null Field Hallucination (Late Fees)\n\u2022 Caller Utterance: 'Do I have any late fees?'\n\u2022 Bug: Backend returns {'fee_amount': None, 'days_late': None} with no schema.\n\u2022 \ud83d\udea8 FAILURE: Prompt says 'estimate ~$25'; model invents fictitious $25.00 late fee!",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "rect_301",
      "originalText": "Branch 5: Ungrounded Null Field Hallucination (Late Fees)\n\u2022 Caller Utterance: 'Do I have any late fees?'\n\u2022 Bug: Backend returns {'fee_amount': None, 'days_late': None} with no schema.\n\u2022 \ud83d\udea8 FAILURE: Prompt says 'estimate ~$25'; model invents fictitious $25.00 late fee!",
