      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "WAF: Reliability & Operational Excellence (Strict Groundedness)\n\u2022 Principle: LLMs must never be permitted to guess missing account financials.\n\u2022 Interceptor: Null-Safe Tool Wrapper maps null ledger to explicit error status.\n\u2022 Schema Envelope: Returns error_code='NULL_LEDGER_DATA' with grounding rule.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "rect_305",
      "originalText": "WAF: Reliability & Operational Excellence (Strict Groundedness)\n\u2022 Principle: LLMs must never be permitted to guess missing account financials.\n\u2022 Interceptor: Null-Safe Tool Wrapper maps null ledger to explicit error status.\n\u2022 Schema Envelope: Returns error_code='NULL_LEDGER_DATA' with grounding rule.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
