      "text": "Remediation: Null-Safe Error Envelope\n\u2022 Tool validates null fields: if fee_amount is None -> explicit error.\n\u2022 \u2705 Returns error_code='NULL_LEDGER_DATA' (fee_amount=None).\n\u2022 Agent Action: 'Ledger unavailable; do NOT guess or fabricate dollar amount.'",
