    {
      "id": "txt_362",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 72,
      "y": 1670,
      "width": 696,
      "height": 135,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#c92a2a",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 364,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 728,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\u26a0\ufe0f Why Naked Models Fail in Enterprise Systems\n1. Probabilistic Reasoning is Non-Deterministic: LLMs cannot enforce hard security\n   boundaries, authentication gates, or retry ceilings through prompts alone.\n2. Cascading Latency Collapse: Without client SLA timeouts, unhandled backend hangs\n   exhaust caller patience and trip hard telephony platform limits (Harpoon 30s).\n3. Untrusted Data Execution: LLMs naturally obey injected imperative commands in\n   database payloads unless quarantined by strict Zero-Trust Data Envelopes.\n4. Hallucination Under Uncertainty: In the absence of structured error codes, models\n   fabricate plausible financial numbers (fictitious $25 fees) to fill knowledge voids.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "rect_361",
      "originalText": "\u26a0\ufe0f Why Naked Models Fail in Enterprise Systems\n1. Probabilistic Reasoning is Non-Deterministic: LLMs cannot enforce hard security\n   boundaries, authentication gates, or retry ceilings through prompts alone.\n2. Cascading Latency Collapse: Without client SLA timeouts, unhandled backend hangs\n   exhaust caller patience and trip hard telephony platform limits (Harpoon 30s).\n3. Untrusted Data Execution: LLMs naturally obey injected imperative commands in\n   database payloads unless quarantined by strict Zero-Trust Data Envelopes.\n4. Hallucination Under Uncertainty: In the absence of structured error codes, models\n   fabricate plausible financial numbers (fictitious $25 fees) to fill knowledge voids.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "rect_365",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 860,
      "y": 1660,
      "width": 840,
      "height": 155,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#d0ebff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
