      "text": "\ud83d\udc15 Sled Dog Harness Engineering: Core Takeaways\n1. Synchronous Callbacks Beat Async Supervisors: Intercepting auth gates in\n   before_model_callback halts execution before tokens or TTS audio are spent.\n2. Bound Every Loop in Deterministic Code: Retry limits and circuit breakers belong\n   in session.state counters, never in natural language prompt wishes.\n3. Never Pass Raw ORM/Backend Models: Clean Data Facade DTOs project strictly public\n   fields, sanitizing internal database secrets and API tokens at the network boundary.\n4. Strict Groundedness via Normalized Envelopes: Translating null values into explicit\n   error codes (NULL_LEDGER_DATA) completely inoculates against hallucinations.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "rect_369",
      "originalText": "\ud83d\udc15 Sled Dog Harness Engineering: Core Takeaways\n1. Synchronous Callbacks Beat Async Supervisors: Intercepting auth gates in\n   before_model_callback halts execution before tokens or TTS audio are spent.\n2. Bound Every Loop in Deterministic Code: Retry limits and circuit breakers belong\n   in session.state counters, never in natural language prompt wishes.\n3. Never Pass Raw ORM/Backend Models: Clean Data Facade DTOs project strictly public\n   fields, sanitizing internal database secrets and API tokens at the network boundary.\n4. Strict Groundedness via Normalized Envelopes: Translating null values into explicit\n   error codes (NULL_LEDGER_DATA) completely inoculates against hallucinations.",
